1
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:12,000
You can only push an innocent man so far

2
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Man on a Ledge is a action, thriller, crime film directed by Asger Leth.

3
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:24,000
An ex-cop turned con threatens to jump to his
death from a Manhattan hotel rooftop.

4
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:30,000
The NYPD dispatch a female police psychologist to talk him down.

5
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:36,000
However, unbeknownst to the police on the scene, the suicide attempt
is a cover for the biggest diamond heist ever pulled.

6
00:30:36,000 --> 00:30:42,000
Nick Cassidy, played by Sam Worthington.

7
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:48,000
Lydia Mercer, played by Elizabeth Banks.

8
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:54,000
Joey Cassidy, played by Jamie Bell.

9
00:45:54,000 --> 00:46:00,000
Mike Ackerman, played by Anthony Mackie.

10
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
Jack Dougherty, played by Edward Burns.

11
00:56:06,000 --> 00:56:12,000
Angie, played by Genesis Rodriguez.

12
01:01:12,000 --> 01:01:18,000
Man on a Ledge is a 2012 American action thriller film directed by Asger Leth, starring Sam Worthington,
Jamie Bell, Elizabeth Banks, Edward Burns, Anthony Mackie, Genesis Rodriguez, and Ed Harris.

13
01:06:18,000 --> 01:06:24,000
Filming took place in New York City on top of the Roosevelt Hotel.

14
01:11:24,000 --> 01:11:30,000
The film received generally negative reviews from critics and
grossed $47 million against its $42 million budget.

15
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
In the film, a man using an alias stages a suicide attempt and
asks to speak with a specific police negotiator.

16
01:21:36,000 --> 01:21:42,000
He is himself a disgraced police officer who was convicted of a
diamond theft, and seeks a way to clear his name.

17
01:26:42,000 --> 01:26:48,000
His associates try to prove that the diamond was never stolen, and that the
"theft" was part of an insurance fraud scheme by the diamond's owner.

18
01:31:48,000 --> 01:31:54,000
The film explores themes of new york city, deception,
rooftop, diamond heist, framed for a crime.

19
01:36:54,000 --> 01:37:00,000
The tone is intense.
